00:35:52.600 --> 00:35:56.350
So I'll say, in general,

00:35:57.620 --> 00:35:59.870
n data points,

00:36:00.600 --> 00:36:03.280
d features.

00:36:07.640 --> 00:36:08.300
Yeah?

00:36:08.300 --> 00:36:12.200
What is the i on the xi? I mean,
