00:36:20.000 --> 00:36:25.250
Versus if I have the big matrix
x times parameter vector w,

00:36:25.500 --> 00:36:28.740
that produces my predictions for
all n data points.

00:36:28.740 --> 00:36:31.160
So the subscript i means we're
referring to just one data

00:36:31.160 --> 00:36:32.160
point.

00:36:32.840 --> 00:36:33.480
Good.

00:36:33.480 --> 00:36:33.780
Yeah?

00:36:33.780 --> 00:36:37.580
Does that mean that the x's are
