00:38:11.580 --> 00:38:16.260
and it allows you to write the
multiple linear regression model

00:38:16.260 --> 00:38:21.340
as a dot product between a
parameter vector

00:38:23.160 --> 00:38:28.120
and not a feature vector but
what I will call an augmented

00:38:28.120 --> 00:38:31.980
