00:41:16.680 --> 00:41:18.380
Just to write that out here.

00:41:18.380 --> 00:41:22.880
X1 would be something like this.

00:41:25.360 --> 00:41:30.560
The augmented X1 would have a 1,

00:41:30.560 --> 00:41:32.360
and then the 10.816,

00:41:32.360 --> 00:41:35.160
and then the 15.

00:41:35.160 --> 00:41:37.900
The first augmented feature
