error.

00:56:56.600 --> 00:56:58.620
We care about the mean squared
error on some other data we

00:56:58.620 --> 00:57:00.120
haven't seen.

00:57:00.400 --> 00:57:04.040
And making the model too highly
specific to the training data

00:57:04.040 --> 00:57:07.000
can cause worse

00:57:07.000 --> 00:57:12.780
performance

00:57:12.780 --> 00:57:16.540
on unseen data.

