is

01:08:41.860 --> 01:08:46.580
the direction of

01:08:46.580 --> 01:08:50.040
steepest increase.

01:08:51.880 --> 01:08:55.440
What does this mean?

01:08:57.460 --> 01:09:03.060
This is not an idea that existed
